# Doom (W11-S05) started from the Go kernel's console with the Freedoom WAD
# on the FAT disk at /mnt. Doom draws only on screen, so steps after its
# start are timed: the title, then Enter four times (menu, New Game, the
# episode, the skill) into E1M1, a walk forward, and Quit Game from the
# menu (Escape, up wraps to the last item, Enter, y).
wait burrow> 
type run /bin/doom -iwad /mnt/freedoom1.wad
key ret
wait Auto-scaling
sleep 4
screendump build/screen-doom-title.ppm
key ret
sleep 1
key ret
sleep 1
key ret
sleep 1
key ret
sleep 4
screendump build/screen-doom-e1m1.ppm
key up
key up
key up
sleep 1
key esc
sleep 1
key up
sleep 1
key ret
sleep 1
type y
wait burrow> 
type poweroff
key ret
